      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SONNYBOY (3) finished second at Kilmore two starts back then did a great job again at his latest appearance over 1609m at at Geelong, beaten 1.2 metres into second after being up on the pace from the outset. Sure to enjoy an economical run from this draw. Primary contender based on that latest outing. KYVALLEY MISTY (8) went back last start then worked home fairly to finish 23 metres from the winner in fifth at Melton over 2240m, that effort following a modest fourth at Kilmore the run prior. Can settle just behind them and wait on the sprint lane. Won't find this any harder and she can find winning ways. MONEY TALKS (6) didn't do a bad job when sixth over 2180m at Kilmore last time out. CHARLIE WALKER (2) is worth some thought despite his last-start sixth over 1690m at this track on October 12.",
